 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.5.4-rc13 — Safe, automatic updates
+
+- **Fixed a serious updater bug**: UWX was still checking VRCX's update server. As soon as stock VRCX published a newer version, UWX would have downloaded it and offered to install it, replacing UnderWeb X. UWX now only updates from UnderWeb X's own releases on GitHub.
+- Only the UnderWeb X installer from this project's releases is downloaded, and only with a SHA-256 checksum, which is verified before installing. Anything else is ignored.
+- Versions are compared properly (rc9 < rc10 < final release), so you're never "updated" to an older build.
+- **Channels**: Stable (finished releases) or Beta (also test builds). Your choice is remembered.
+- System → **Updates**: installed vs latest, channel, automatic download on/off, download progress, and Restart & install. Settings and data are kept when updating.
+
 ## 0.5.3-rc12 — Group activity (audit log) + clearer invites
 
